# Name: Fiveflake
# Summary: Five scaled copies bloom from every segment into a branching pentagonal flake.
# Visualizer: turtle_2d
# Angle: 72
# Iterations: 2
# Max Iterations: 2
# Initial Color: 5

# ID       : LSYS-235FFEE95631
# Source   : jkubin/L-system M4 catalog (commit 68a699a) | pentaline.ls | https://github.com/jkubin/L-system/blob/68a699a/pentaline.ls
# Formalism: deterministic context-free turtle string with terminal homomorphism
# Fidelity : equivalent
# Features : context-free, deterministic, terminal-homomorphism, turtle2d
# Heading  : 0
# Draw     : F K R G B M N L
# Move     : f HalfMove
# Profile  : turtle2d-generic
