# JKUBIN | ___DESCR(⟦five lines as star⟧)
# JKUBIN | ___USAGE(⟦m4 lsys.m4 pentaline.ls | turtle_plotter⟧)
# JKUBIN | 
# JKUBIN | AXIOM(⟦PENTALINE⟧, ⟦[FA]-[FA]-[FA]-[FA]-[FA]⟧)
# JKUBIN | RULE(⟦A⟧, ⟦<[FA]-[FA]-[FA]-[FA]-[FA]>⟧)
# JKUBIN | 
# JKUBIN | divert⟦⟧dnl turtle configuration
# JKUBIN | ANGLE(72),dnl
# JKUBIN | SCALE(2.62),dnl
# JKUBIN | "step":600,dnl
# JKUBIN | 
# JKUBIN | PENTALINE(5)
